<p>Here it is! My entry for the 4000 contest! A huge thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/countless-skies" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3477314); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3477314&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530710851" alt="Countless Skies" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3477314)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/countless-skies" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3477314); return false;">Countless Skies</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drfred" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1377450); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1377450&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530710851" alt="DrFred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1377450)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drfred" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1377450); return false;">DrFred</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530710851" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span> for their feedback and critique, with an even more huge thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/humidhermit" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3956486); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3956486&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1530710851" alt="HumidHermit" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3956486)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/humidhermit" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3956486); return false;">HumidHermit</a></span> who gave feedback and critique on this in both Ideas and Brainstorming and Drafts and Critiques! They were all a tremendous help and I wouldn't have been able to write this without them.</p>
