<p>Wow you're fast.</p>
<p>Just another plot hole I noticed: in the description you said this about the Alpha:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>While acquiring a sample of SCP-4000-α, living or otherwise, is currently impossible, some hypothesizes can be formed from visual records</p>
</blockquote>
<p>But in Addendum C you wrote:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>At the point where MTF Omega-14 would normally re-manifest, an instance of SCP-4000-α appeared instead</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Upon her death, several instances of SCP-4000-α manifested in the location Agent M██████ had re-manifested</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If I'm right in thinking that the contestants &quot;re-manifest&quot; on Earth, then the Alpha could have been captured and studied.</p>
<p>Other than that, +1.</p>

